{"3969080":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"MapleStory M","steam_appid":3969080,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to rediscover the warmth and excitement that your remember in MapleStory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MapleStory M is a 2D side-scrolling MMORPG that faithfully captures the charm and fun of MapleStory,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >beloved by global players over the years.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3969080\/extras\/36e2caf9bd07ea3f7399db720e5156df.avif?t=1792027228\" width=1011 height=187 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of Maple World and experience all kinds of stories together, with unique towns, monsters, and NPCs full of personality.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiar pixel graphics and smooth animations that transcend generations add depth to the unique feeling of MapleStory<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3969080\/extras\/0a7e229672a623517310acd716a4e3da.poster.avif?t=1792027228\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3969080\/extras\/0a7e229672a623517310acd716a4e3da.webm?t=1792027228\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3969080\/extras\/0a7e229672a623517310acd716a4e3da.mp4?t=1792027228\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3969080\/extras\/ea94557a3d5a55dcc89804e25921862c.avif?t=1792027228\" width=895 height=187 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as dozens of different jobs, like Warrior, Magician, Thief, Pirate, and Archer, and more. Each job has their own distinct skills and battle styles.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own unique character with extensive customization options for your hair, face, outfits, and more.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3969080\/extras\/0c19dec99be2a9ffa50915d17ed387ea.poster.avif?t=1792027228\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3969080\/extras\/0c19dec99be2a9ffa50915d17ed387ea.webm?t=1792027228\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3969080\/extras\/0c19dec99be2a9ffa50915d17ed387ea.mp4?t=1792027228\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3969080\/extras\/9ae965dd949b3aff9057cf09716bfc80.avif?t=1792027228\" width=1056 height=187 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy your adventures faster than ever with content made just for beginning and returning users, like MapleStory M's own simple growth system, auto-battle options, Tera Burning, and more.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradually progress your character through story quests, hunting, boss raids, and equipment farming, and then try your hand at stronger challenges.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3969080\/extras\/6b66ab307d2a09a5d8160b87b2e13534.avif?t=1792027228\" width=1560 height=439 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3969080\/extras\/64222e35bc794ca4de22828e94293247.avif?t=1792027228\" width=963 height=187 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the fun of working together by conquering all kinds of battle patterns in boss raids that you can enjoy by yourself or with a friend.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you defeat powerful bosses, you can get rare items and rewards you need to enhance equipment.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3969080\/extras\/d1a758611b2255eb00eb50902131eea4.poster.avif?t=1792027228\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3969080\/extras\/d1a758611b2255eb00eb50902131eea4.webm?t=1792027228\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3969080\/extras\/d1a758611b2255eb00eb50902131eea4.mp4?t=1792027228\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3969080\/extras\/e66de8ea1ea970e3dc476f0ffd0ea6be.avif?t=1792027228\" width=1011 height=187 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can keep coming back long-term, as each season introduces new content and reasons to level up,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >like the guild system, social content, signature mini-games, event-based updates, and more.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3969080\/extras\/a194048d61963d6975bb3e7ce8229649.poster.avif?t=1792027228\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3969080\/extras\/a194048d61963d6975bb3e7ce8229649.webm?t=1792027228\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3969080\/extras\/a194048d61963d6975bb3e7ce8229649.mp4?t=1792027228\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to rediscover the warmth and excitement that your remember in MapleStory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MapleStory M is a 2D side-scrolling MMORPG that faithfully captures the charm and fun of MapleStory,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >beloved by global players over the years.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3969080\/extras\/36e2caf9bd07ea3f7399db720e5156df.avif?t=1792027228\" width=1011 height=187 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of Maple World and experience all kinds of stories together, with unique towns, monsters, and NPCs full of personality.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiar pixel graphics and smooth animations that transcend generations add depth to the unique feeling of MapleStory<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3969080\/extras\/0a7e229672a623517310acd716a4e3da.poster.avif?t=1792027228\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3969080\/extras\/0a7e229672a